{
  "slug": "atp",
  "name": "Atp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Design, spec, and evaluate crypto exchange features — grounded in Vietnamese law, security incidents, and protocol analysis. From idea to actionable solutions in minutes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `attack-composition` (Cross-domain composition attack on an agent system), `compare-systems` (Compare agent systems on governance maturity — what's working, what's a known gap, and what's a blind spot), `design-feature` (Design a compliant exchange feature with cross-domain trade-off analysis), `design-protocol` (Design or evaluate a protocol configuration for a specific use case), `evaluate-legal` (Evaluate legal and regulatory compliance under Vietnamese law), `review-compliance` (Review whether an activity is truly compliant — not just legally covered, but defensible in practice), `review-security` (Review security posture across domains), `spec-feature` (Generate governance-aware implementation specifications from a design decision)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `atp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install atp@claude-community` from `s27183/adi-atp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
